@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam padding 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title change-v2 候补报名与自动递补时序图

actor "学生 S002" as S2
actor "学生 S001" as S1
participant "RegistrationService" as Service
participant "WaitlistRegistrationPolicy" as Policy
participant "RegistrationRepository" as RegRepo
participant "EventBus" as Bus
participant "SiteMessageHandler" as Msg
participant "EmailNotificationHandler" as Mail

== 场景一：活动满员后报名进入候补 ==
S2 -> Service : register(activityId, S002)
Service -> RegRepo : 查询有效报名 / 统计 approved
RegRepo --> Service : approved = capacity
Service -> Policy : decide(RegistrationContext)
Policy --> Service : WAITLISTED
Service -> RegRepo : INSERT registration(WAITLISTED)
Service -> Bus : publish(registration.waitlisted)
Bus -> Msg : handle(event)
Msg -> RegRepo : INSERT message
Bus -> Mail : handle(event)
Mail -> Mail : INSERT email_outbox
Service --> S2 : 状态 = 候补中

== 场景二：已通过报名取消，最早候补自动递补 ==
S1 -> Service : cancel(registrationId, S001)
Service -> RegRepo : UPDATE status = CANCELLED
Service -> RegRepo : earliestByStatus(WAITLISTED)
RegRepo --> Service : S002（最早加入）
Service -> RegRepo : UPDATE S002 = APPROVED
Service -> Bus : publish(registration.cancelled)
Service -> Bus : publish(registration.promoted)
Bus -> Msg : 写入取消/递补站内消息
Bus -> Mail : 写入取消/递补邮件
Service --> S1 : 状态 = 已取消

note over Service
  取消与递补在同一事务内完成；
  活动已开始或已下架时不递补；
  事件在事务提交后发布，通知失败不回滚报名。
end note
@enduml
